  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danmission COVID-19 Emergency Pool project RE-value Syria: Building Up Relational Values in Syrian Communities 2020-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to contribute to a better future for the war generation in Syria, where relational values inspire active citizenship, leading to opportunities for human flourishing.

12 community leaders, representative of socio-religious makeup of the target area, participate in expert council sessions producing a framework for promotion of relational values in their community.

60 children participate in series of &#xbd;-day workshops using materials based on expert council input.

60 adults trained in values seminar, 40 thereof receive 3 individual counselling sessions for trauma relief.

240 adults and children participate in community events.</narrative>
  </description>
